## Undocumented rules

The rules that exist only in someone's head. The highest-value rows in the engagement.

**Protect the holder.** The rule exists because the official process is inadequate, so surfacing it can look like surfacing a workaround they are responsible for. Frame every one as a process finding, never as individual behaviour.

